ion":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","number":23,"title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2978,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-05-22T16:25:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T16:23:23Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-01-26T18:09:14Z"},"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-09-17T14:20:13Z","updated_at":"2026-01-25T09:36:09Z","closed_at":"2025-09-30T16:26:18Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110616","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110616","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110616.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110616.patch","merged_at":"2025-09-30T16:26:18Z"},"body":"This PR was made in response to this comment https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98750#discussion_r2355594383\r\n\r\nI don't think there is any harm in always applying this hack to all float serialization. As a brief reminder, in *all cases*, this is strictly better than the behavior in Godot 4.4.\r\n\r\nIn Godot 4.4 and earlier, it would always serialize 6 digits of a float, which resulted in precision loss when serializing. In Godot 4.5, it uses Grisu2 instead to precisely serialize, however this can cause problems when Godot tells Grisu2 to serialize a double when the underlying data was a 32-bit float. I added a hack in PR #98750 that checks if it's equivalent to the 32-bit float value, and then serializes assuming the value is a 32-bit float, which seamlessly avoids issues for users, though it does mean that for double sources, 1 in 2^29 values will be off by 2^-23.\r\n\r\nThis PR changes this to apply to all floats, including Vector2, Vector3, Packed*Arrays, etc. In practice, this only changes behavior for Vector2, Vector3, etc for double-precision builds of Godot, and it has just one behavior change for single-precision builds of Godot, PackedFloat64Array. Test code:\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\nfunc _ready() -> void:\r\n\tvar vec := Vector2(0.1, 0.2)\r\n\tprint(var_to_str(vec))\r\n\tprint(var_to_str(PackedFloat64Array([vec.x, vec.y])))\r\n```\r\n\r\nIn master, this is printed:\r\n\r\n```\r\nVector2(0.1, 0.2)\r\nPackedFloat64Array(0.10000000149011612, 0.20000000298023224)\r\n```\r\n\r\nWith this PR, this is printed:\r\n\r\n```\r\nVector2(0.1, 0.2)\r\nPackedFloat64Array(0.1, 0.2)\r\n```","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110616/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":2,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110616/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}